}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Three steps with the default settings. Each vertex is a state reached by one \
history, so the graph is a tree:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1377816002,ExpressionUUID->"6ee45b93-a0df-d1f6-169c-52dcd16ba3dc"],

