  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1dbf9c2b-d84a-d79b-4b44-1674d9fcbde1"],
 " selects which applications are one event. The event records of two steps, \
with isomorphic states identified:"
}], "Text",
